real Postgres	Stop containers	2026-09-20T23:20:22.7879531Z  	  -- activity (the back-room table + patronage), decays hourly; past the threshold the owner's collect rolls
real Postgres	Stop containers	2026-09-20T23:20:22.7880014Z  	  -- a lazy raid that seizes pending income + fines the owner + SHUTTERS the club (shut_until).
