real Postgres	Stop containers	2026-09-20T23:20:22.8110875Z  	-- every authed request with `WHERE account_id = $1 AND alive` (§7.1 lazy accrual makes even a READ take
real Postgres	Stop containers	2026-09-20T23:20:22.8111071Z  	-- it), and 78 further sites across src/ look a character up by account. The table carried indexes on
real Postgres	Stop containers	2026-09-20T23:20:22.8111272Z  	-- name, lower(name), respect, lfg and seeking_mentor — every SECONDARY lookup — and none on the join
